			"baseEffect": "<p><strong>Tier 5 · 2 Actions · Range 12 · Blast 2.</strong></p><p><strong>Damage:</strong> 4d4. On a failed DEX save, targets entirely in the area are pushed up 8 spaces in the air. Targets in the air are Restrained and land Prone at the start of their next turn.</p>",
